{!<p class="other">!}[? if bourgeois_negotiations_1930_timer == 3 and bourgeois_negotiations_fail_dstp and not lvp_formed: The negotiations between the bourgeois parties have finally concluded, with the parliamentary alliance failing primarily due to the erratic behavior of the <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>, which has alienated all parties to its right. It seems that bourgeois cooperation remains little more than a pipe dream, even with major financial contributors conditioning their continued support on closer collaboration. ?]{!</p>!}
